---
/**
 * Contact.astro
 * ATO 5: BOUNTY BOARD CONTACT & TRANSMISSION
 * Chamada magnética para novos contratos e projetos de alto impacto.
 * 100% Bebop Design Tokens + Tailwind CSS v4.
 */
---

<section
  id="contact"
  class="relative border-t-[0.7rem] border-space-base bg-space-surface-1 px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-24 md:px-12 md:py-32 text-paper-white select-none overflow-hidden"
  aria-label="Contato e Envio de Propostas — Bounty Board"
>
  <!-- Faixa Editorial Superior -->
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[140rem]">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between gap-4 pb-6 border-b border-space-border/60">
      <div>
        <span class="mb-2 block font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-widest text-bebop-amber uppercase">
          [ ACT V // BOUNTY BOARD • DISPATCH & TRANSMISSION ]
        </span>
        <h2
          data-contact-title
          class="font-display text-[clamp(2.4rem,7vw,6.5rem)] font-black tracking-tight text-paper-white leading-none uppercase"
        >
          TRANSMIT A BOUNTY
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-acid-green animate-ping" />
        <span class="font-bold text-acid-green tracking-wider uppercase">
          AVAILABLE FOR HIGH-IMPACT CONTRACTS
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid Principal de Contato -->
    <div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
      <!-- Coluna da Esquerda: Chamada Editorial e Botão Magnético de E-mail -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-paper-white leading-relaxed">
            Tem um desafio de engenharia complexo, quer construir uma interface imersiva a 60 FPS ou precisa de uma arquitetura de computação distribuída robusta?
          </p>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-gray leading-relaxed">
            Construo software com precisão cirúrgica, código limpo inegociável e estética memorável. Vamos colocar sua nave em órbita.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Botão Magnético Primário de Ação -->
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="mailto:bruno.a.dinis96@gmail.com?subject=[Bounty%20Contract]%20Proposta%20de%20Projeto%20//%20Bruno%20Dinis&body=Ol%C3%A1%20Bruno,%0A%0AGostaria%20de%20conversar%20sobre%20uma%20oportunidade%20de%20projeto%20/%20contrato.%0A%0ADetalhes:%0A-"
            data-primary-contact-btn
            class="group inline-flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 w-full p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border-4 border-space-base bg-bebop-red text-paper-white shadow-comic-lg hover:bg-paper-white hover:text-space-base hover:border-space-base transition-all duration-200 active:translate-x-1 active:translate-y-1"
          >
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-bebop-amber group-hover:text-space-base/80 uppercase block">
                // DIRECT FREQUENCY COMM
              </span>
              <span class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight block">
                TRANSMITIR PROPOSTA DIRETA
              </span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-paper-white/80 group-hover:text-space-base block">
                bruno.a.dinis96@gmail.com
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 self-end sm:self-center font-mono text-sm font-bold bg-space-base text-paper-white group-hover:bg-space-base group-hover:text-acid-green px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-space-border shadow-comic-xs transition-colors">
              <span>DISPATCH</span>
              <span>⚡</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Canais de Conexão Rápidos -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/BrunoAndradeDinis"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-space-border/80 bg-space-surface-2/80 hover:border-acid-green hover:text-acid-green transition-all shadow-comic-xs block"
          >
            <span class="text-[10px] text-muted-gray uppercase block mb-1">CODE BASE //</span>
            <span class="font-bold block">GitHub @BrunoAndradeDinis</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bruno-de-andrade-dinis"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-space-border/80 bg-space-surface-2/80 hover:border-crt-cyan hover:text-crt-cyan transition-all shadow-comic-xs block"
          >
            <span class="text-[10px] text-muted-gray uppercase block mb-1">CAREER LOG //</span>
            <span class="font-bold block">LinkedIn /in/bruno-de-andrade-dinis</span>
          </a>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-space-border/80 bg-space-surface-2/80 shadow-comic-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-muted-gray uppercase block mb-1">STATION BASE //</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-bebop-amber block">Campinas / SP • Remote</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Coluna da Direita: Espaço reservado para o Mini-Terminal Bounty Dispatch (Story 7.2) -->
      <div id="bounty-dispatch-container" class="lg:col-span-5">
        <!-- Renderizado dinamicamente pelo componente React BountyDispatch.tsx -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
